      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "I was able to spin up a current build from the {{main}} branch, and all of the test failures boil down to this not being implemented yet. So I voted for this issue, since I think it's the main blocker to testing 6.0 prereleases with Valkyrie and Hyrax apps.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
